  "description": "This package provides robust implementations extending the core repository abstractions for Entity Framework Core (EF Core), emphasizing the utilization of globally unique identifiers (GUIDs) as database IDs. Drawing upon the foundational principles of its precursor, this toolkit facilitates .NET developers with streamlined methods to work with databases where entities have GUIDs as their primary identifiers. A meticulously crafted solution by Inoxie, tailored for projects that leverage GUIDs for entity identification.",
